    <div class="cell large-7 medium-7 small-12">
      <h2>Advanced hospital care, built around you</h2>
      <p>UT Health San Antonio Multispecialty and Research Hospital brings together an unsurpassed
        network of physicians, medical innovation, personalized surgical and inpatient care, and the
        powerful resources of an academic health center in one place.</p>
      <p>Designed around patients with complex and unique care needs, the hospital connects you with
        experienced teams, lifesaving technology and coordinated care throughout your experience.</p>
      <p><a href="#" class="button">Explore the UT Health San Antonio Multispecialty and Research Hospital</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

